1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,120
Why, Dad?

2
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,720
I really love him.

3
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,960
Just like you and Mom.

4
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,520
You've restricted me so much
since I was little

5
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,920
that I have nothing left.

6
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,680
I only have him.

7
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,280
He makes me feel like I'm still alive.

8
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:28,720
Dad,

9
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,280
I-I've never asked you for anything.

10
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,960
Just this once, please?

11
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,200
Yanyan.

12
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,720
I'd consider

13
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,640
anyone else

14
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,480
but Song Yanfei.

15
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,280
He is

16
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,760
absolutely out of the question.

17
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:55,680
Why?

18
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,300
There must be a reason.

19
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,960
Tell me why.

20
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,039
Look up

21
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,080
the news from eight years ago

22
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:15,280
about Dacheng Group.

23
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,120
Song Yanfei's father

24
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,000
is Song Yucheng.

25
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:23,600
Song Yucheng.

26
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:26,360
If I remember correctly...

27
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,960
Dacheng Group

28
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,200
shares a warehouse with us, right?

29
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,240
Do you have the profile

30
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,000
on this guy named Bai?

31
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,130
Bai Jiuzhou.

32
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,039
Gender, male.

33
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:39,240
Age, 42.

34
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,250
Family members:

35
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,400
wife Zhao Wenjuan,

36
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,120
39.

37
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,520
Son Bai Xiaosi,

38
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,039
nine.

39
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:44,479
Hey,

40
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:45,560
do you know how to drive?

41
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,690
Bai Jiuzhou's work status.
Position, western suburbs.

42
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:50,640
Everyone has a weakness, right?

43
00:01:50,759 --> 00:01:51,759
I'm so sorry.

44
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,759
It's fine. You can go.

45
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:54,960
An apology is enough.

46
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,759
I'm really sorry.

47
00:01:58,479 --> 00:01:59,080
By the way,

48
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,060
do you like playing with toys?

49
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,640
Toys? What toys?

50
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,000
You've been so tired lately.

51
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,530
You must be on a mission.

52
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,210
You shouldn't ask that.

53
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,440
It's my job.

54
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,520
I can't tell you.

55
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,020
It's protocol.

56
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,640
Besides,

57
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,720
it has nothing to do with you, right?

58
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,440
It does, Li Xingchen.

59
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,280
It directly concerns me.

60
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,840
Song Yucheng is your dad.

61
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,720
I really didn't expect

62
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,600
this

63
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,840
to drive him to his death.

64
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,720
Wending Group narrowly
escaped being framed!

65
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,440
He just

66
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,360
wasn't cut out for business.

67
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:48,960
He couldn't handle the pressure at all.

68
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:49,720
But

69
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,000
I must congratulate you.

70
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,920
From now on,

71
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,640
I'll have to call you

72
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,240
Mr. Bai.

73
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,440
Mr. Bai!

74
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,480
It is reported that the accident occurred

75
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,560
on the night of October 23, 2002.

76
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,480
Song Yucheng, chairman of Dacheng Group,

77
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,800
disguised banned materials
as industrial raw materials.

78
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,720
His coercive measure has been changed
to residential surveillance.

79
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:21,250
The surveillance location is
right behind me at Dacheng Group.

80
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,560
Good evening, viewers.

81
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,520
I am a reporter from Pioneer TV.

82
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,720
Just last night,

83
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,680
a severe car accident occurred

84
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,240
on the road behind me.

85
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,600
A Honda sedan suddenly
lost control while driving

86
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,480
and crashed into

87
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,540
a pedestrian heading home from work.

88
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,520
According to the investigation,

89
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:41,040
the pedestrian is currently undergoing
emergency treatment in the hospital.

90
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:41,840
It is reported...

91
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,920
The passerby, surnamed Bai,

92
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:46,050
is a warehouse keeper
in the western suburbs of our city.

93
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,079
Hey,

94
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,280
honey.

95
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,740
Are you done with work?

96
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,760
All right, heading home.

97
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:12,800
I hope you don't mind.

98
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,680
This music box

99
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:16,880
means a lot to me.

100
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,600
Now I'm giving it to you.

101
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,320
I believe

102
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,900
everything happens for the best.

103
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,240
Thank you.

104
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:16,760
Yayan, if you are reading this letter,

105
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,080
it means my spirit

106
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,080
is still not at peace.

107
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,320
First of all,

108
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,940
please don't blame me.

109
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:25,240
I really hoped

110
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:27,970
you and Song Yanfei
could live happily together.

111
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,380
But on second thought,

112
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:32,000
if things are really as I suspect,

113
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,040
it might be dangerous

114
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,240
for you too.

115
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:40,040
Yayan, ever since
I caused Xiao Ze's death,

116
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,330
I've dreamed of his face every day.

117
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,320
Do you know

118
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:45,520
what really made me choose death?

119
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,720
It wasn't entirely to save Song Yanfei,

120
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,800
but to accept the punishment

121
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,300
Xiao Ze gave me before he died.

122
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,360
Song Yanfei,

123
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,080
we were wrong.

124
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,000
We kept making mistakes,

125
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,240
one after another.

126
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:10,720
Xiao Ze punished me by giving up his life.

127
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,000
I was wondering

128
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,200
if I could also

129
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,600
punish you by giving up mine.

130
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:18,760
To punish you for your so-called revenge,

131
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,960
for attacking,

132
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,560
using,

133
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,880
and brainwashing me.

134
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,560
I can die,

135
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:27,160
but I can't bring myself
to lay a hand on you.

136
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:29,120
Then I will leave this letter

137
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,920
to fate.

138
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,600
Why?

139
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,680
Why?

140
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,360
Why?

141
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,000
Why?

142
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,420
Officer Li,

143
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:33,760
I have

144
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:34,920
important

145
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,050
physical evidence.

146
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:38,800
I want to report Song Yanfei.

147
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,480
You mean,

148
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,480
besides that

149
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:42,800
recording,

150
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:45,140
she wrote a separate suicide note to you?

151
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:46,640
It was in

152
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,040
the music box she gave me.

153
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,280
What does it say?

154
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,340
What did she write?

155
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:50,840
A lot.

156
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:52,760
I'll send it to you via MMS.

157
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,120
No, tell me right now.

158
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,440
Is he the killer?

159
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,400
Did he plan everything?

160
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:56,920
Did he?

161
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:59,320
Listen, wait for me at home.

162
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,520
We'll be right there.

163
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,720
And I need to warn you,

164
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,980
do not let him find out.

165
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,040
Otherwise, you'll be in danger.

166
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,770
Understand?

167
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:08,730
Chief Wu.

168
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,300
Take action immediately.

169
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,360
Where are you now?

170
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,880
I'll wait for you in the greenhouse.

171
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:36,720
Jiang'er,

172
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,490
hurry up.

173
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,600
Yanyan,

174
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,860
What's wrong, Yanyan?

175
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,260
What's wrong? Why do you look so pale?

176
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:03,960
What is it?

177
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,640
Yanfei,

178
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:15,160
what is actually true?

179
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,170
Everything is true.

180
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,780
What happened?

181
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,640
It's true that you killed my dad.

182
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,660
It's true that you killed Xiao Ze.

183
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:38,040
Tricking me into marriage
for my family's wealth,

184
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,240
and even plotting

185
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,280
to kill me

186
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,100
if I refused to divorce...

187
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,480
that's also true,

188
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:48,560
right?

189
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,520
You know everything.

190
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,570
The marriage fraud isn't true.

191
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:11,540
And killing you for the money
in the future is definitely not true.

192
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:21,200
I've known for a long time

193
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,280
that it was you and Shen Xi...

194
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,490
The one who killed my dad...

195
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,520
That day at the police station,

196
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:36,800
when I saw that car,

197
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,260
I understood everything.

198
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,160
I understood

199
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:43,720
that you planted the car,

200
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,300
and Shen Xi was the one who hit him.

201
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:50,040
You two conspired to murder him.

202
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,680
Tear it up.

203
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,880
It's just a copy anyway.

204
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,280
Song Yanfei!

205
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,320
My dad warned me long ago.

206
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,440
You are

207
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,280
Song Yucheng's son.

208
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,260
You're just here for revenge.

209
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,520
Yanyan,

210
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,040
I'm begging you.

211
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,200
Leave Song Yanfei.

212
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,840
I promise to give him a fortune

213
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,120
to get the hell back to Beijing.

214
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,200
He can do whatever

215
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,520
dance drama he wants.

216
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:24,090
As long as he has nothing to do with you,

217
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,240
okay?

218
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:25,840
No.

219
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,440
Why are you acting so self-righteous?

220
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,120
What are you feeling guilty about?

221
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,120
What right do you have to control me?

222
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,600
While you put on a show

223
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:39,240
of mourning my mom...

224
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:42,960
Sleeping with women and finding mistresses

225
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,680
right in front

226
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,760
of my mom...

227
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:48,640
did you think I didn't know
about these filthy things?

228
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,360
Gao Yayan!

229
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:51,640
Gao Yuhai!

230
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,440
Sit down and talk.

231
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,280
Yanyan,

232
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,120
I am your father.

233
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,580
You have to believe me.

234
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,840
Song Yanfei's motive for approaching you

235
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,280
is definitely not pure.

236
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:32,360
I did some things back then

237
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,340
that went a bit too far.

238
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,720
But this is business.

239
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:39,600
Business

240
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,320
is full of deception.

241
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,600
Song Yanfei's father

242
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:44,920
couldn't handle the pressure

243
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,560
and jumped off a building to his death.

244
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:48,290
Can you really blame that on me?

245
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,850
Dare you say you didn't
orchestrate all this?

246
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,330
Acquiring Dacheng Group at a low price

247
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,520
and ruining their family.

248
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,610
Have you ever felt
the slightest bit of guilt?

249
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,320
You haven't.

250
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,770
All you care about is money.

251
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,320
Even if

252
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,370
Song Yanfei came to seek revenge on you

253
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,680
and used me...

254
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,480
fine.

255
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:29,440
Then let me pay your debt for you.

256
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,240
Gao Yuhai,

257
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:35,600
this is all your karma.

258
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:47,760
Yanyan,

259
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:50,560
do you hate me that much?

260
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,600
Your grandparents hated me

261
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,500
for causing their daughter's death.

262
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:08,040
And you followed them,

263
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:11,120
hating me for killing your mom.

264
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,040
Right?

265
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,540
It's not just me who hates you.

266
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:22,420
All the innocent souls you killed

267
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,560
hate you.

268
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,040
It terrifies me.

269
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,280
Why do I have a father like you?

270
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:36,880
How could

271
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:38,960
my mom fall for

272
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,400
a beast in human clothing like you?

273
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:45,250
And even lost her life
giving birth to your child.

274
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,120
She didn't deserve this.

275
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:58,120
Actually, I had a vague feeling

276
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,930
about what you were going to do.

277
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:01,480
I thought you

278
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,140
would just punish him at most.

279
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,600
I didn't expect you to be so ruthless

280
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:10,880
as to take his life.

281
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:19,440
You must be wondering why

282
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,800
I didn't expose you

283
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,880
and even helped you

284
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,450
hide it when I knew everything.

285
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,520
Because I love you too much.

286
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,560
I love you too much.

287
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:44,060
So I couldn't bring myself to turn you in.

288
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,320
I could only keep all this pain

289
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,800
to myself.

290
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:55,040
I hate myself!

291
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,160
No matter how much I hate him,

292
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,360
he is my dad.

293
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:04,240
How could I want him dead?

294
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:07,480
Not to mention

295
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,680
it was my lover who killed him.

296
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:18,360
So I could only

297
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,880
convince myself...

298
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,680
I forced myself

299
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,520
to believe...

300
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:30,520
that he did a lot of bad things,

301
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:34,480
and this is the karma he couldn't escape.

302
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:37,880
Yeah.

303
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:40,480
So, Yanyan...

304
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,160
It's all over,

305
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:45,680
isn't it?

306
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,880
I admit it.

307
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:50,920
When I first approached you,

308
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:52,980
I knew you were Gao Yuhai's daughter.

309
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:54,480
But

310
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:57,080
when I first saw you,

311
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,000
I really couldn't bear

312
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,480
to drag you into this.

313
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:01,940
I really couldn't.

314
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:03,890
As we spent more time together,

315
00:17:05,359 --> 00:17:07,359
I realized you truly understood me.

316
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:09,960
Do you remember when we were

317
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,200
creating the dance drama?

318
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,280
We shared our thoughts

319
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,800
and what resonated with us.

320
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,040
We even showed each other

321
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,200
our scars.

322
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:19,220
We were really good together.

323
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,900
And I thought about

324
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,040
letting go of my hatred

325
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,680
and just being with you.

326
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:27,520
Having a baby

327
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:28,780
and starting a family.

328
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:32,440
Yanyan,

329
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,280
I realized I truly fell in love with you.

330
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,720
Stop saying that,

331
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:47,080
and don't mention
the word "baby" to me again.

332
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:49,400
Song Yanfei,

333
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,280
I've just been wondering...

334
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:58,200
The day we first met,

335
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,300
was that version of you

336
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:04,400
really just an act?

